L1: Lower vascular conductance responses to handgrip exercise are improved following acute antioxidant supplementation in young individuals with post‐traumatic stress disorder
L2: Experimental Physiology (2024)
L3: Jennifer B. Weggen, Ashley M. Darling, Aaron S. Autler, Austin C. Hogwood, Kevin P. Decker, Jacob Richardson, Gina Tuzzolo, Ryan S. Garten
